# Strategy fixtures and their calibration hashes are byte-level contracts.
# Keep checkout bytes stable on every CI runner and developer platform.
* text=auto eol=lf

# New entries go to docs/worklog/<date>-<branch>.md, one file per PR, because
# GitHub's own conflict check ignores merge drivers. Union still lets local git
# merge the nightly roll-up and any direct edit without a hand-resolve.
docs/WORKLOG.md merge=union
